<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', background: '#FFFFFF', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 80, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>质量 · 三层验收，证据说话</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C9D8F0' }}>实验室设备预约系统 · 吴辰枫</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 100, left: 40, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 520, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>能跑不等于可信</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 120, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>10</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>条业务规则测试<br />全部通过（R1–R10）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>冲突检测、取消释放、改期换档、到期判定、占用矩阵、AI 用量统计——每条规则都由人点名后写成用例，不是 AI 自己"看着办"。</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '8px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', fontSize: 22 }}>7</span> 个封卷 tag · 每天可验证</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '8px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>CI 每次 push 自动跑</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '8px 14px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>线上公网可访问</Text></Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>AI 说的"完成"不算数，跑过才算。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>第 6 天用像素检测抓出"数据正确但未渲染"的图表缺陷——客观验证比肉眼可靠。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
            <Image src="assets/shot-dashboard.png" style={{ width: 620, height: 388, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>数据看板真实界面：KPI 与三图全部由 localStorage 中的真实预约数据驱动，支持一键导出 CSV</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 668, left: 40, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>Vibe Coding 集中实践 · 实验室设备预约系统</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>05 / 06</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
